{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_0153ESvVrHxkbXpSjUZQy1cm", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.visitczechia.com/zh-cn/things-to-do/places/nature/mountains/a-white-carpathians\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kuluarpohod.com/en/articles/fakty-o-gorah/the-highest-carpathian-peaks/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/?p=2012\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/tours/mountain-highlights/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://peakvisor.com/data/peak/hoverla\"}, {\"url\": \"https://karpaty.rocks/en/node/21592\"}, {\"url\": \"https://peakvisor.com/adm/carpathian-mountains.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.summitpost.org/mountain/rock/173530/Hoverla.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://peakvisor.com/range/carpathian-mountains.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.summitpost.org/mountain/rock/173530/hoverla.html\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:48:45.347Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "喀尔巴阡山脉最高峰", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01BwQN4vjeRxnizpJgmhKHKM", "content": [{"title": "a white carpathians", "url": "https://www.visitczechia.com/zh-cn/things-to-do/places/nature/mountains/a-white-carpathians"}, {"title": "the highest carpathian peaks", "url": "https://kuluarpohod.com/en/articles/fakty-o-gorah/the-highest-carpathian-peaks/"}, {"title": "The highest peaks INkraїof the Carpathian Mountains", "url": "https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/?p=2012"}, {"title": "The highest peaks INkraїof the Carpathian Mountains", "url": "https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/tours/mountain-highlights/"}, {"title": "peakvisor.com", "url": "https://peakvisor.com/data/peak/hoverla"}, {"title": "Mount Brebeneskul", "url": "https://karpaty.rocks/en/node/21592"}, {"title": "Get PeakVisor App", "url": "https://peakvisor.com/adm/carpathian-mountains.html"}, {"title": "Page Type Page Type: Mountain/Rock", "url": "https://www.summitpost.org/mountain/rock/173530/Hoverla.html"}, {"title": "Get PeakVisor App", "url": "https://peakvisor.com/range/carpathian-mountains.html"}, {"title": "Page Type Page Type: Mountain/Rock", "url": "https://www.summitpost.org/mountain/rock/173530/hoverla.html"}]}, "搜索结果没有直接给出整个喀尔巴阡山脉的唯一最高峰，但有几条相关信息：\n\n- **整个山脉的最高区域：** PeakVisor指出，High Tatras of Slovakia and Poland are the highest peaks in the Carpathians，即高塔特拉山（斯洛伐克与波兰交界）是喀尔巴阡山脉海拔最高的区域。其中，该来源列出的Lomnicky Štit (2,634 m / 8,642 ft)。来源中没有明确把某座山标为全山脉第一，但我据常见资料补充：斯洛伐克的Gerlachovský štít（格拉洛夫峰，约2655米）通常被视为该地区最高峰，这一点结果中没有直接证实，建议进一步核实。\n- **乌克兰境内最高峰：** Hoverla（霍韦尔拉山，2061米）是乌克兰喀尔巴阡山的最高峰，It is the most famous mountain in the country.，第二高的是Brebeneskul（约2036米）。\n- **罗马尼亚东喀尔巴阡山区：** The highest peak in the Eastern Carpathians is Pietrosul Rodnei (2,303 m / 7,556 ft) in the Rodna Mountains of Romania.\n- **白喀尔巴阡山（捷克-斯洛伐克）：** 其最高峰是Velká Javořina，海拔970米。\n\n简而言之，若指整个喀尔巴阡山脉，通常答案是高塔特拉山区的峰峦（如Gerlachovský štít）；若指单一国家或子山脉，则分别是乌克兰的霍韦尔拉山、罗马尼亚的Pietrosul Rodnei等。"], "durationSeconds": 7.730550000000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_0153ESvVrHxkbXpSjUZQy1cm", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
